Z||000000||My7Fieros||06-09-2000||02:12 PM||||Ok, I know this is a stupid question, but whats the deal with the map pockets on the dash? Theres the solid ones, the carpeted backed ones, and that ever so popular band/strap thing. Are they year specific? Just wondering...||||reg||5
Z||000001||Monkeyman||06-09-2000||02:23 PM||||No idea except that the Monkeymobile ('86 2m4) had that stupid band/strap thing and the Grape Ape ('85 GT) has the leather/vinyl full length "pocket".||||reg||1
