Z||000005||TheFiero64||06-09-2000||08:38 PM||||My 84 SE & 88 coupe have a <B>leather/vinyl Pocket</B>. My 86 SE & GT have the <B>cloth back w/ a leather/vinyl pocket</B>. My friends 85 2m4 has that <B>strap thingy</B>.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Who knows what Pontiac had in mind, but I like the <B>cloth backed leather pocket</B> look the best.<p>[This message has been edited by TheFiero64 (edited 06-09-2000).]||||reg||6
